# Testing local rules

- Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/engineering/testing.md` first.
- Package-level deterministic Go tests are colocated as `*_test.go`.
- Real DB, cross-module, or network-backed tests are integration tests and must
  be explicitly labeled/configured; browser journeys belong to E2E.
- Put fixtures and sample/mock data in `testdata/`.
- Prioritize business rules, state transitions, permissions, SQL contracts,
  regression cases, and complex algorithms. Coverage percentage alone is not a
  reason to add low-value tests.
- Never weaken/delete a test or relabel a real integration test merely to make a
  gate green.
